window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When famed psychic Alicia Lysander is brutally attacked after leaving a seance at the home of an earl, Jason Redmond and Daniel Haze must retrace her movements to determine who might have had a motive to want Alicia dead. As they delve into the private life of the woman who had not only become a friend but had also helped Daniel to rescue his abducted daughter, they uncover buried secrets, bitter rivalries, and unexpected betrayals.</p> <p>Can Jason and Daniel isolate the motive and apprehend the killer in an investigation that has become unexpectedly personal?</p>"; 
